Redfluent Mail (web client)
===========================

This is a MODIFIED version of Twake Mail.

Upstream:   Twake Mail (tmail-flutter) by LINAGORA and contributors
            https://github.com/linagora/tmail-flutter
            tag v0.39.3, commit a64d63305553697e0df3d03609cb8d88f1dacc9d
License:    GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE, unchanged from upstream)

Modified by Redfluent on 2026-10-08 and 2026-10-09 (first commit of this repository = the
unmodified upstream v0.39.3 tree; the following commits = Redfluent's changes). The changes
are branding (2026-10-08) and, on 2026-10-09, a Simplified Chinese language option, English as
the default language, a "Change password" link and translation fixes, (rf3) removal of
the unused banner-text script and more "Change password" translations, (rf4) self-hosted
fallback fonts (Noto, SIL Open Font License 1.1, web/fonts/) and more Chinese translations,
(rf5) the Redfluent name of the "download all attachments" zip file, and (rf6) Chinese drawn
without waiting for fonts: a patch to LINAGORA's linagora-design-flutter package
(patchs/linagora_design_flutter-font-fallback.patch, applied at build time by
scripts/prepare_design_system.sh to upstream commit 0d402e4f5a371cd88fb1a0671e2c7d902aaa2918;
the package itself is not included here) and a subset of the bundled Noto Sans SC
(assets/fonts/fallback/NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf, SIL Open Font License 1.1, made by
scripts/subset_noto_sans_sc.py; its copyright and license name records are kept); see
README.md, section "Changes from upstream".

All copyright notices of the upstream work are preserved. This program is distributed
WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; see sections 15 and 16 of the LICENSE.

"Twake" and "LINAGORA" are names of LINAGORA. This project is not affiliated with or
endorsed by LINAGORA.

The Redfluent logo files (assets/images/redfluent_logo_mark.png, web/favicon.png,
web/icons/*.png, web/splash/img/redfluent_logo.png) are derived from
https://www.redfluent.com/logo-transparent.png and identify Redfluent; they are not
needed to build or run the program.
